[en.FOCUS_C12_DEVELOP_BREEZIE_VILLAGE]
Develop Breezie Village

[en.FOCUS_C12_DEVELOP_BREEZIE_VILLAGE_desc]
The rock farm’s army has now completely taken control of this area, and I will utilize it more effectively. The few local ponies will immediately become citizens of the rock farm, while all other Breezies will be relocated to special reservations to continue their lives. Considering their safety, they will be overseen by designated ponies.

[zh.FOCUS_C12_DEVELOP_BREEZIE_VILLAGE]
开发风仙子领土

[zh.FOCUS_C12_DEVELOP_BREEZIE_VILLAGE_desc]
如今采石农场的军队已经彻底控制了这块地方，我将更好的利用这里。当地少数的小马将成为采石农场的公民，其余所有风仙子将被转移到特别的保留区继续生活下去，考量到他们的安全，他们将被专门的小马负责看管。

